      "writtenOn": "2019-10-09T20:59:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we will not change the config very often but imagine this case. IgmpOnPodBasis is true, you will receive the first join and you forward - ok. You receive the second join and you don\u0027t forward and set to false firstJoinAcrossDomain. Now I change the config to set IgmpOnPodBasis on false.\n\nI do believe that you need a way to reset the internal variables firstJoin and lastLeave otherwise you will not forward the packets accordingly.",
      "parentUuid": "deba7eaf_9ad74b3c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 31
