      "writtenOn": "2019-10-09T20:59:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess you can have this problem if you receive packets related to the same group from different devices, right ?\n\nPerhaps if you implement the suggestion I made in the IGMPManager you will not need anymore these locks. Right ?",
