      "writtenOn": "2019-10-07T14:58:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, it is on purpose. Assume two different threads trying to acquire the lock at the same time. Just one of them acquires it and creates the machine instance. The second one should not create a new machine instance when it acquires the lock. That is why I check whether the machine instance has already been created or not when the lock is acquired. I will code it in a more readable way, please see the next patch.",
